<body data-new-gr-c-s-loaded="14.1045.0" style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><br />
Your intent to claim for <b>{!Case.Freight_AWB_Number__c}</b> has been submitted
<br/>
Reference number: <b>{!Case.CaseNumber}</b>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Thank you for completing the first step of our claims process.  
<br/>
<br/>
This is not a formal claim yet as we still need a few details from you. Without these, there may be a delay with processing your request.  
<br/>
<br/>
<h3>Next step: lodge a formal claim</h3>
To lodge a formal claim, you’ll need to provide additional information. For more details on the required information, please refer to <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/us-en/help/claims.html">Claims Help</a> on our website.
</br>
</br>
Formal claims must be lodged within a specified timeframe which vary depending on the type of claim. Further information is available on our <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/us-en/help/claims.html">website</a> in our <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/us-en/conditions-of-carriage-international.html">Conditions of Carriage (outside of Australia)</a>.

<br/>
<br/>
<h3>Where to send this information</h3>
<b>
<b>Claims for international shipments (eligible for receivers only)</b>
<ul>
    <li>If the final destination is <b>within Australia or New Zealand</b>, reply to this email with the additional information required and quote the AWB details in the subject line.</li>
</br>
<li>If the final destination is within the United States, send an email to qffreightusa@qantas.com.au with the additional information required and quote the AWB details in the subject line. </li>
    </br>
    <li>If the final destination is <b>outside Australia or New Zealand or the US</b>, the receiver must contact their local <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/us-en/freight-terminals.html#international">Qantas Freight office</a> or ground handling agent and follow their claims process as local regulations vary.</li>
</ul>
</br>
<b>Your shipment details </b>
