<b>A reminder that specific <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/us-en/help/claims.html">time limitations</a> apply for lodging your formal claim. </b>
</br>
</br>
<h2>We’re here to help</h2>
If you need assistance with lodging a formal claim or have any further questions, get in touch with our Customer Service Team at <b>+1 800 227 0290</b> (Toll free within USA only) during business hours or reply to this email.
</br>
</br>
Thank you for your patience as we work to resolve your claim.
</br>
